.github
.workbuddy
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]

src
tests
scripts
docs
data
models
alembic
alembic.ini
compose.yaml
compose.prod.yaml
Dockerfile
pyproject.toml
uv.lock

frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/e2e
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
